  "item": {
    "entry": {
      "id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1",
      "headword": "曹操",
      "kind": "name",
      "reading": "Cáo Cāo",
      "senses": [
        {
          "id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1",
          "definition": "Cao Cao, a person in the passage"
        }
      ]
    },
    "examples": [
      {
        "sentence": "曹操在这时第一次出现。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "曹操随后继续追他们。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "黄巾军起兵后，曹操带着五千名士兵赶到颍川。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "那时张梁、张宝已经败退，曹操率军拦住他们，立即发动攻击。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "曹操的军马都打着红旗，从前面截住黄巾军的去路。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "这一战中，曹操杀死一万多人，夺得旗子、战鼓和许多马匹。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "曹操见过皇甫嵩和朱隽，便带兵继续追击张梁、张宝。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "曹操以前做官时，也很重视城里的规矩。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "一次，有人夜里带刀走路，曹操把他抓住，按禁令用木棒责罚。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "于是，城内城外的人都不敢犯法，曹操也获得了很大的威名。",
        "gloss": "Cao Cao",
        "sense_id": "zh-4fbe01ab8d14-1-s1"
      }
    ],
    "linked_components": []
  },
